@ClinicSystem.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5220

GET {{ClinicSystem.Web_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
@host = http://localhost:5220

### ყველა სპეციალობა
GET {{host}}/api/specialties

### შექმნა
POST {{host}}/api/specialties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Neurology"
}

### ერთი id-ით
GET {{host}}/api/specialties/3

### განახლება
PUT {{host}}/api/specialties/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Neurology"
}

### წაშლა
DELETE {{host}}/api/specialties/1

